/Assets/AssetStoreTools*

# Written by the Performance Testing Extension on every test run and full of
# this machine's hardware details.
#
# These two files are the only thing here that should be ignored. The rule used
# to be the whole `/Assets/Resources/` folder, which swept out everything else
# in it — and *everything under a Resources folder is what the game loads by
# name at runtime*. A teammate who cloned the repo got no
# `PawliceAndPurrglarDefaultFont`, so `Resources.Load<TMP_FontAsset>` returned
# null and every Korean string in the game rendered as blank boxes.
#
# Widen this again and the same thing happens, quietly, to whoever clones next.
/Assets/Resources/PerformanceTestRunInfo.json*
/Assets/Resources/PerformanceTestRunSettings.json*

# Burst leaves generated WebGL plugin sources at the repo root after a WebGL
# build. Build output, not source.
/Data/

